      "source": "stable_dt",
      "fact": "SM8250 UFS iommus contains apps_smmu SID 0x0e0 and 0x4e0 with zero masks. This is upstream DT evidence; the native sampled UFS node does not contain iommus."
    },
    {
      "source": "stable_ice",
      "fact": "ICE VERSION register offset 0x8 is accepted only for major 3 or 4; unsupported version returns EOPNOTSUPP. SCM service availability and clocks are checked before version access."
    },
    {
      "source": "stable_ufs",
      "fact": "The UFS Qualcomm driver converts EOPNOTSUPP from ICE acquisition to absent ICE and continues initialization."
    },
    {
      "source": "vendor_ice",
      "fact": "Vendor ICE version validation only rejects major greater than CURRENT_MAJOR; version zero is not a reliable rejection sentinel for this driver. Secure restore is attempted before version verification."
    },
    {
      "source": "vendor_smmu",
      "fact": "Native-style TBU probe maps base/status-reg, reads stream-id-range, allocates optional IRQs and power resources. TBU halt and ECATS MMIO is used in hardware translation/debug paths, not a standalone clock-gating register."
    },
    {
      "source": "stable_smmu",
      "fact": "Upstream qcom SMMU normal translation uses architectural SMMUv2 with Qualcomm implementation hooks; this version does not enumerate native qcom,qsmmuv500-tbu children for SM8250 normal DMA."
    }
